abstract: >
  Open institutional dataset containing anonymized student-level records from
  online higher education programs at Universidad ECOTEC (Ecuador). The public
  release contains 12,632 unique student records and 18 variables and supports
  reproducible research in learning analytics, educational data mining,
  institutional analytics, explainable artificial intelligence, fairness-aware
  AI, and educational decision-support systems.

keywords:
  - learning analytics
  - educational data mining
  - online higher education
  - reproducible AI
  - student risk analytics
  - fairness-aware AI
  - explainable AI
  - institutional analytics

